#: src/lib/progressCards.ts:308
msgid "Activate all of your knights at once, for free, but they come up freshly activated, so none of them can act until your next turn."
msgstr "Activez tous vos chevaliers d’un coup, gratuitement, mais ils arrivent fraîchement activés : aucun ne peut agir avant votre prochain tour."

#: src/lib/locationActions.ts:588
#: src/lib/locationActions.ts:604
#: src/lib/locationActions.ts:628
